# Secrets at any depth (a nested .env would otherwise reach an image through COPY of its directory), and deploy state
# (pg_dump backups under .deploy/backups). Checked by inspecting a built image: build-log/reports/ghcr-promote.md.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.deploy
**/.deploy
**/.tmp
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
